      <dl class="kv">
        <dt>Source</dt><dd class="mono">{{ arcana2_src_path }} (bind-mounted at /workspace)</dd>
        <dt>Containers</dt><dd class="mono">arcana-dev :4100, arcana-dev-2 :4101</dd>
        <dt>Console</dt><dd><a href="https://{{ tailscale_hostname }}:{{ arcana2_nginx_port }}">https://{{ tailscale_hostname }}:{{ arcana2_nginx_port }}</a></dd>
        <dt>Database</dt><dd><span class="mono">arcana_dev</span> on YugabyteDB (homelab-net)</dd>
        <dt>LLM</dt><dd>Anthropic API (key in a root-only env file)</dd>
        <dt>Live reload</dt><dd>host edits recompile into the running node in a few seconds</dd>
        <dt>Playbook</dt><dd class="mono">playbooks/arcana2.yml</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Add Arcana's own details here</h3>
      <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.85rem">The Arcana session writes up to three HTML fragments in the arcana2 repo and the homelab publishes them into this page: summary tiles, hierarchy items, and detail cards or diagrams.</p>
      <dl class="kv">
        <dt>Files</dt><dd class="mono">{{ arcana_overview_dir }}/</dd>
        <dt>Slots</dt><dd><span class="mono">overview-summary.html</span> · <span class="mono">overview-hierarchy.html</span> · <span class="mono">overview-details.html</span></dd>
        <dt>Publish</dt><dd class="mono">ansible-playbook playbooks/nginx.yml --tags overview</dd>
      </dl>
      <p style="margin:0.7rem 0 0"><a href="/arcana-overview-contract.txt">Instructions for the Arcana process →</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
{% if arcana_details | length > 0 %}
{{ arcana_details }}
{% else %}
  <div class="ph">No Arcana-provided details yet. Point the arcana2 session at <code>~/homelab/docs/arcana-overview-contract.md</code> (also at <a href="/arcana-overview-contract.txt">/arcana-overview-contract.txt</a>) and have it create the fragments listed above.</div>
{% endif %}
</section>

<!-- ===================== OPERATIONS ===================== -->
<section id="ops">
  <h2>Operations <small>backup, monitoring and change control</small></h2>
  <div class="grid2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Backup</h3>
      <dl class="kv">
        <dt>Tool</dt><dd>restic, nightly at 03:00</dd>
        <dt>Repository</dt><dd class="mono">/mnt/nas/backups/homelab</dd>
        <dt>Paths</dt><dd class="mono">/home /etc /opt/compose /opt/vaults /opt/cache /var/lib/docker/volumes</dd>
        <dt>Offsite</dt><dd>the NAS syncs to S3 independently</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Monitoring</h3>
      <dl class="kv">
        <dt>Health check</dt><dd>Claude headless run at 08:00 → <span class="mono">health-reports/</span> (disk, memory, containers, restic age, failed units, security updates, temperatures)</dd>
        <dt>Mail</dt><dd>alerts and cron output relay through postfix to Gmail</dd>
        <dt>Disks</dt><dd>smartd and mdmonitor</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Change control</h3>
      <dl class="kv">
        <dt>Rule</dt><dd>every system change goes through an Ansible playbook, dry run first</dd>
        <dt>Record</dt><dd>commit to GitHub + <span class="mono">runbooks/YYYY-MM-DD-task.md</span></dd>
        <dt>Containers</dt><dd>compose templates in <span class="mono">templates/</span> deployed to <span class="mono">/opt/compose/&lt;service&gt;/</span></dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>Generated by playbooks/nginx.yml (<code>--tags overview</code>) from templates/homelab-overview.html.j2 — edit those, not this file. This is a configuration view as of {{ overview_snapshot_date }}; counts, disk usage and tailnet device status are snapshots, not live data.</footer>
</main>
</body>
